        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        td, th { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
        .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .logo-area { display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; margin-right: 20px; }
        .contact-info { font-size: 12pt; }
        .footer-info { text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt; }
        .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .metadata-table td { padding: 4px 0; }
    </style>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo-area img {
    height: 60px; /* Placeholder for logo size */
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  .contact-info p {
    margin: 2px 0;
    font-size: 12pt;
  }
  .footer-sig {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    right: 60px;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-info">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <div class="logo">A</div>
            <div>
                <span data-field="agency_name_1">{{ agency_name_1 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_address">{{ agency_address }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_phone">{{ agency_phone }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_fax">{{ agency_fax }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <span data-field="document_title">{{ document_title }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="header-box">
        <span data-field="document_description">{{ document_description }}</span>
    </div>

    <p>
        <span data-field="document_note">Només és vàlid per annexar-ho, en format pdf (més de 3MB) al Formulari disponible a l'Oficina Virtual de Tràmits (OVT) que haureu d'enviar telemàticament <a href="{{ document_url }}">www.gencat.cat/ovt</a></span>
    </p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Dades del/de la coordinador/a del grup de recerca</h3>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Nom</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Primer cognom</td>
            <td style="width: 40%;">Segon cognom</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span data-field="coordinator_first_name">{{ coordinator_first_name }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="coordinator_first_surname">{{ coordinator_first_surname }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="coordinator_second_surname">{{ coordinator_second_surname }}</span></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Universitat/Centre/Institució</td>
            <td style="width: 70%;">
                <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Nom del grup i acrònim si escau</td>
            <td style="width: 70%;">
                <span data-field="group_name">{{ group_name }}</span>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Modalitat</td>
            <td style="width: 70%;">
                <span data-field="group_modality">{{ group_modality }}</span>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">
        <sup>1</sup>Especificueu si és DNI, NIE, Passaport.
        <br>
        <sup>2</sup>Introduïu el vostre número d'identificació (p. ex.: el DNI, NIE....)
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
            <div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">
                    <span data-field="generalitat_name">{{ generalitat_name }}</span>
                    <br>
                    <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <img src="placeholder_sgs_seal.png" alt="SGS Seal" style="width: 100px;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-info">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <div class="logo">A</div>
            <div>
                <span data-field="agency_name_1">{{ agency_name_1 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_address">{{ agency_address }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_phone">{{ agency_phone }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="agency_fax">{{ agency_fax }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <span data-field="document_title">{{ document_title }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">a) Inputs: principals fonts de finançament de la recerca obtinguts al període 2009-2013</h3>

    {% for project in projects %}
    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <p>
            <strong><span data-field="project_title">{{ project.title }}</span></strong>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span data-field="project_description">{{ project.description }}</span>
        </p>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Entitat finançadora:</td>
                <td style="width: 70%;"><span data-field="project_funder">{{ project.funder }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Referència de la concessió:</td>
                <td><span data-field="project_reference">{{ project.reference }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Entitats participants:</td>
                <td><span data-field="project_participants">{{ project.participants }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Quantia de la subvenció:</td>
                <td><span data-field="project_amount">{{ project.amount }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Duració de:</td>
                <td><span data-field="project_start_date">{{ project.start_date }}</span> fins a <span data-field="project_end_date">{{ project.end_date }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Nre. d'investigadors/res membres del grup participants en aquest projecte:</td>
                <td><span data-field="project_team_size">{{ project.team_size }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">b) Output: producció científica del grup, publicacions i accions de transferència durant el període 2009-2013</h3>

    {% for output in outputs %}
    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <p>
            <strong><span data-field="output_title">{{ output.title }}</span></strong>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span data-field="output_description">{{ output.description }}</span>
        </p>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Autors/res (per ordre de signatura):</td>
                <td>
                    {% for author in output.authors %}
                        <span data-field="output_author[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ author.name }}</span>
                        {% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Revista (títol, volum, pàgina inicial-final):</td>
                <td><span data-field="output_journal">{{ output.journal }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Any:</td>
                <td><span data-field="output_year">{{ output.year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Index d'impacte (SCI/SSCI):</td>
                <td><span data-field="output_impact_sci">{{ output.impact_sci }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Altres index de qualitat (consignar base de dades i index d'impacte):</td>
                <td><span data-field="output_other_index">{{ output.other_index }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ISSN:</td>
                <td><span data-field="output_issn">{{ output.issn }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
            <div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">
                    <span data-field="generalitat_name">{{ generalitat_name }}</span>
                    <br>
                    <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <img src="placeholder_sgs_seal.png" alt="SGS Seal" style="width: 100px;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

